Description: Distributed key-value store with a hand-written LSM storage engine and Raft
 consensus
 Ironclad replicates data with Raft and keeps it in an LSM-tree storage engine
 with a write-ahead log, SSTables, bloom filters and compaction. A cluster of
 three or five nodes survives the loss of a minority. This package ships the
 server, the ironclad-cli client and a systemd unit (disabled by default).

